      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUMMER ANGEL (1) boasts a strong record this course with four wins and seven minors from 12 tries. In the money last time at this track (29.97) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 5 length second. Looks well placed and should feature. GRANT KEEPING (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (29.96) at Dubbo behind Motor City Sonny in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Hard to beat again. CAWBOURNE OZZY (5) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 5 lengths at this track in a handy 29.63 beating SUMMER ANGEL. Has a strong record from box 5, including two wins. Has definite claims. CLASSY BANDIT (4) must be included in calculations.",
